com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQTGlsb0FIdWo5T2tOODlLOXp2RWdlLXA1WDNKdm1Xbl94QXVfMUJfVHhXYUw4a2dGMHRsTy1sT2JYT2JlZ2ljMXBFb2N0U1lDTXJTZmxma0VsYVVrQXpYLXFBRE1fc1dwTWZhQ0QtVVZncHFCRHpkZDFCSVljeUU5bzR4cWtrQldUTUFxZk5qYmFZcmtSeW5HcFg5RThmaXFVWnhXa1oxU2V2UQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"沃爾瑪承諾斥資 60 億美元擴大 Symbotic 交易 路透社"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":7},{"name":"國防/軍工","count":1},{"name":"關稅/貿易","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-13","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/104169/000010416926000055/wmt-20260131.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Walmart Inc. (\"Walmart,\" the \"Company\" or \"we\") is a people-led, technology-powered omnichannel retailer dedicated to helping people around the world save money and live better by providing the opportunity to shop in both retail stores and through eCommerce, and to access our other service offerings. Through innovation, we strive to continuously improve a customer-centric experience that seamlessly integrates our eCommerce and retail stores in an omnichannel offering that saves time for our customers. Each week, we serve approximately 280 million customers who visit more than 10,900 stores in 19 countries and through our numerous eCommerce websites and mobile applications.","zh":"沃尔玛公司（“沃尔玛”、“公司”或“我们”）是一家以人为本、以技术为动力的全渠道零售商，致力于通过提供在零售店和电子商务购物以及使用我们其他服务产品的机会，帮助世界各地的人们省钱并过上更好的生活。通过创新，我们努力不断改善以客户为中心的体验，将我们的电子商务和零售店无缝集成到全渠道产品中，从而为客户节省时间。 Each week, we serve approximately 280 million customers who visit more than 10,900 stores in 19 countries and through our numerous eCommerce websites and mobile applications."},{"en":"Our strategy is to make every day easier for busy families, operate with discipline, sharpen our culture and become more digital, and make trust a competitive advantage. Making life easier for busy families includes our commitment to price leadership, which has been and will remain a cornerstone of our business, as well as increasing convenience to save our customers time. By leading on price, we earn the trust of our customers every day by providing a broad assortment of quality merchandise and services at everyday low prices (\"EDLP\"). EDLP is our pricing philosophy under which we price items at a low price every day so our customers trust that our prices will not change under frequent promotional activity. Everyday low cost (\"EDLC\") is our commitment to control expenses so our cost savings can be passed along to our customers.","zh":"Our strategy is to make every day easier for busy families, operate with discipline, sharpen our culture and become more digital, and make trust a competitive advantage.讓客戶的家庭生活更輕鬆包括我們對價格領先的承諾，這將是基礎透過價格領先，我們以每日低價（「EDLP」）提供各種優質商品和服務，每天贏得客戶的信任。 EDLP 是我們的定價理念，我們每天以低價對商品進行定價，以便我們的客戶相信我們的價格不會在頻繁的促銷活動中發生變化。日常低成本（「EDLC」）是我們控制開支的承諾，以便我們的成本節省可以惠及我們的客戶。"},{"en":"Our operations comprise three reportable segments: Walmart U.S., Walmart International and Sam's Club U.S. Our fiscal year ends on January 31 for our United States (\"U.S.\") and Canadian operations. We consolidate all other operations generally using a one-month lag and on a calendar year basis. Our discussion is as of, and for the fiscal years ended, January 31, 2026 (\"fiscal 2026\"), January 31, 2025 (\"fiscal 2025\") and January 31, 2024 (\"fiscal 2024\"). During fiscal 2026, we generated total revenues of $713.2 billion, which primarily comprised net sales of $706.4 billion.","zh":"我們的業務包括三個可報告部門：沃爾瑪美國公司、沃爾瑪國際公司和山姆會員店美國公司。我們的美國（「美國」）和加拿大業務的財政年度於 1 月 31 日結束。我們通常以一個月的延遲時間和日曆年為基礎來合併所有其他業務。我们的讨论截至2026年1月31日（“2026财年”）、2025年1月31日（“2025财年”）和2024年1月31日（“2024财年”）结束的财年。 2026 財年，我們的總營收為 7,132 億美元，其中主要包括 7,064 億美元的淨銷售額。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Competition. We compete with brick and mortar, eCommerce and omnichannel retailers operating discount, department, retail and wholesale grocery, drug, dollar, variety and specialty stores, supermarkets, supercenter-type stores, membership-only warehouse clubs, gasoline stations and social commerce platforms, as well as companies that offer services in digital advertising, fulfillment and delivery services, health and wellness and financial services. Our ability to develop and effectively operate different formats at the right locations and to deliver a customer-centric omnichannel experience largely determines our competitive position in the retail industry within the markets where we operate. Each of these landscapes is highly competitive and rapidly evolving, and new business models and the entry of new, well-funded competitors continue to intensify this competition. Some of our compet","zh":"競賽。我们的竞争对手包括经营折扣店、百货店、零售和批发杂货店、药品店、一元店、杂货店和专卖店、超市、超级中心型商店、会员制仓库俱乐部、加油站和社交商务平台的实体店、电子商务和全渠道零售商，以及提供数字广告、履行和送货服务、健康和保健以及金融服务等服务的公司。我们在正确地点开发和有效运营不同业态以及提供以客户为中心的全渠道体验的能力在很大程度上决定了我们在我们经营所在市场的零售行业中的竞争地位。這些領域都競爭激烈且發展迅速，新的商業模式和新的、資金充足的競爭對手的進入繼續加劇了這種競爭。 Some of our compet"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Walmart US","val":485599000000,"zh":"Walmart US"},{"name":"Walmart International","val":131988000000,"zh":"Walmart International"},{"name":"Sams Club US","val":95540000000,"zh":"Sams Club US"}],"total":713163000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":581175000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":131988000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":713163000000}},"peers":["HD","JNJ","COST","TGT","KO"]}}